<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="DAN" style="id">Baebu Thyaa</book>
  <para style="h">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="toc1">Daniel</para>
  <para style="toc2">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="toc3">Dan</para>
  <para style="mt1">DANIEL</para>
  <para style="mt2">Daniel</para>
  <para style="imt">Byalaanmaw</para>
  <para style="ip">Daniel ccauh hynh zynleitu siapharan kuihkaw kya Judah hae nynh vawsawnaw te tuaasahnaw myarya a teing lya hae zeipaw ccauh nynh thua. Ccawzeitu nynh phungpaw hae te vizin hae kha mangte, e ahoy leipaw siapharan hae hynh Pachia nynh a vua cih hae zah Pachia minphuin hae tuh luenaw a muethui cih hae cite ngaehoinaw khate thawzung a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="ip">E ccauh hynh phuin ning lang phia kho athua: (1) Daniel te a ruiban hae nynh see lang tang hae paw kong. E hae nynh Pachia a zynnaw hae te a doliakunaw hae liate mih rhaw hae kha a tae hae. E phungpaw hynh Babilon te Persia uknaw ccyh kya acyihkuhpaw nynh thua. (2) Daniel nynh vizin hae kha po kyngkuh lan muih zah, tuh-e hae tuh Babilon accozah kyate tho zah accozah patae tuh oun langkuh hae zah aro hae paw kong nynh thua; zynleitu siapharan nynh a shung lanpaw kong te Pachia ccungccaw hae nynh taenaw a mue lan hae paw kong kha a hodae.</para>
  <para style="iot">Abyalupi hae</para>
  <para style="io1">Daniel te a ruiban hae 1.1—6.28</para>
  <para style="io1">Daniel nynh a muihpaw vizin hae 7.1—12.13</para>
  <para style="io2">a. Sarepaw sa pali 7.1-28</para>
  <para style="io2">b. Tuutepaw te miaatepaw 8.1—9.27</para>
  <para style="io2">c. Vaawlang te yn thuapaw locceihtu 10.1—11.45</para>
  <para style="io2">d. Athangnaw ccyh 12.1-13</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Babilon kya Israel Ccangvae Lu Pali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Jehoiakim nynh Judah siapharan lang a tangnaw kumthumnaw kum khe Babilon siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem lang yn thua zah a koihlu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:1">2Si 24.1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:5-7">2Sh 36.5-7</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Bawipaw nynh Nebukhadnezzar tuh Judah siapharan Jehoiakim kha kyngsah zah, Pachia inn kya-e uccaw abang kha a lawsah. Tuh-e uccaw hae tuh Shinar ram lang cciakhae zah, a pachia hae inn kya sisua nungnaw khaan kyakhe a nung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:17-18">2Si 20.17-18</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:10-16">24.10-16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2Sh 36.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:7-8">Isa 39.7-8</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh a inn kya-e bawi Ashpenaz kha kawpya zah, kyng athua hae paw Israel hae kya-e siapharan phuin te sawtuanaw a ccoupaw phuin lungkhu e, <verse number="4" style="v" />a pyn ccaenaw um leipaw te a puithyapaw, a hawpaw, nythyanaw te tuathyanaw a hoipaw, siapharan inn kya rya a lahthya cih paw ccangvae hae kha potua hae; minmin nynh Khaldi hae ccaw te bya kha ccangkuh hae sah. <verse number="5" style="v" />Nin takyh a ae lan hae paw looh te a nia lan hae paw misutui tuh siapharan nynh a aepaw kya-e athua cih, cite siapharan nynh a ci. Kum thum lungkhu a ccangkuh cih hae zah, tuh-e ccyh athang te, siapharan inn kya rya a lah cih hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e hae kyakhe Judah phin kya-e Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael te Azariah tuh a umbua hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Siapharan inn kya-e bawi nynh ccangpaw min kha phuthui hae zah: Daniel kha Belteshazzar, Hananiah kha Shadrak, Mishael kha Meshak, Azariah kha Abednego cite a phu hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Daniel nynh siapharan inn e looh te misutui khate amaw toulou kha thusaku lei lante a tuaku; tukeiccuze amaw toulou kha a thusaku khyh nawlan siapharan inn e bawi kha a ngiaku. <verse number="9" style="v" />Pachia nynh siapharan inn e bawi kha Daniel tungvaw thawccinaw te ngaethyaumsahnaw a hoisah. <verse number="10" style="v" />Siapharan inn e bawi nynh Daniel kha, “Ka bawipaw siapharan kha ka rih; aning nynh looh te misutui kha ae paccynpya oh. Nae kum alokuhpaw ccangvae hae laeze na ngethyapaw kha a muih zetuh, siapharan nynh ka lu yn zo vae cih,” a cipya. <verse number="11" style="v" />Tetuh Daniel nynh amaw, Hananiah, Mishael te Azariah tungvaw do-oihtu lang cite siapharan inn e bawi nynh a khangpaw ccungccaw rintu kha ngia zah: <verse number="12" style="v" />Nin haw lungkhu kaening hynh oun syntawtua oh. Ae lanpaw enaw-rohnaw te nia lanpaw tui kyalya kha beih oun pyatua oh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Siapharan inn e tui te looh a ae hae paw ccangvae hae mae te kae mae hynh oun dokhia tua lah, nae muihnaw thyhte kae tungvaw oun cyitua, a cipya. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw rintu nynh tuh-e bya tuh a nawccah zah, nin haw lungkhu a syntawtua hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Nin haw accing nin khe he a do hae tuh, siapharan inn e looh a ae hae paw ccangvae hae balyn laeze mih ngesaw hoyhua zah a thohua lante a lang hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw rintu nynh siapharan inn e mih looh te a nia lan hae paw misutui kha ccaring lah zah, enaw-rohnaw kha a pya hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pachia nynh khah-e lu pali hae kha nynaw, ccaw lante thyanaw te hawnaw kha a pya hae; Daniel mah vizin te maan balyn kha leihthyanaw akhupaw nynaw a hoi.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siapharan inn lungkhu lang teekhae lan cite khyapaw accyh he accing te, siapharan inn e bawi Ashpenaz nynh minmin kha Nebukhadnezzar malang thuakhae hae zah, <verse number="19" style="v" />siapharan nynh bya a hokhae hae. Mih balyn laku kyaze Daniel, Hananiah, Mishael, Azariah te khinkhia lanpaw lu kheit sanmah um khyh hae; tukeiccuze minmin tuh siapharan inn kya ryalahtu lang khang athua hae. <verse number="20" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a khia hae paw hawnaw bya te nythyanaw bya miakaw kyakhe minmin tuh a ram pynpi kya umpaw mitleihthya hae paw te beidinhothya hae paw balyn laeze leit haw a thyahua hae paw kha a muih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Te Sairas Siapharan nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kheitnaw kyacia Daniel tuh tuin kya po a um.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukhadnezzar Maan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum ningnaw kum khe maan ccangkheit sah zah, a lungvaw a sawsah keiccuze ih kho khyh. <verse number="2" style="v" />Tukeiccuze siapharan nynh mitleihthya hae paw, beidinhothya hae paw, naawthya hae paw te Khaldi hae kha a maan leih lan pum khylan kaw a pya hae. Minmin tuh oun thua hae zah siapharan malang he a thadyn hae te,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 41:8">Gen 41.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />siapharan nynh minmin kha, “Maan ccangkheit ka sah zah, tuh-e maan asuilan ka ny ry keiccuze ka lungvawsaw,” a cipya hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Khaldi hae nynh siapharan kha Aramaik bya te khung hae zah,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">E kyate byaria 7 athang cia Hebru bya kha mang leite Aramaik bya kha a mang.</char></note> “Pou siapharan, na hiinshe sae vae sah! Na maan kha kaening oun hopah lah, kae leihpah cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Khaldi hae kyakhe, “E hynh kaw ka thopaw nynh thua: ka maan te ka maan asuilan kha nae leihpya khyh oh ze, nae kuih nae ccu kha pae athua cih zah, nae inn tuh aronahpaw apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Thuasalama ka maan te ka maan asuilan kha nae leihpya kho oh ze, lasung, nae ryalaw mee te alesaepaw sawtuanaw kha kae pya cih oh. Tukeiccuze ka maan te ka maan asuilan kha yn hopya tua oh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Siapharan nynh na maan kha masaty kaening oun hopah lah, na maan kha kae leihpah kho cih,” cite vae ningnaw bya a khung hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Siapharan nynh, “Tynkaring lan kaw ka tho vae paw kha na ny oh keiccuze, accyh khaw cia rosah lanpaw kha na zuaku oh cipaw ccaerarih lan ka ny: <verse number="9" style="v" />Maan kha nae hopya khyh oh ze, nae hanlan detahnaw a um cih. Ccyh arulaeku mawlaezung hynbya hopya lan cite naemaw laku kya nawccawnaw na hoi vae oh. Tukeiccuze maan kha yn hopya tua oh, tetuh maan asuilan nae leihpya kho oh paw kha ka nyh cih,” a cipya hae. <verse number="10" style="v" />Khaldi hae nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan nynh ny na rypaw hynh ae hopah khopaw tuh laephi vawlan lu kheit san um khyh! Alesaepaw te athungpaw siapharan humhung nynh mah mitleihthyapaw, beidin hothyapaw te Khaldi hae kha hynhcihawpaw bya hynh khia boi khyh hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Siapharan nynh na khiapaw bya hynh myaryamaw aru, achih khopaw ccungccaw hae kya a umbua leipaw pachia hae holeite tuh, humhung nynh mah ae hopah kho lan khyh,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />E bya keiccuze siapharan tuh a bung phe paw zah, Babilon khua umpaw mihaw hae balyn kha chia lan kaw a tho. <verse number="13" style="v" />Kaw kha tho thua vae zah, mihaw hae kha chianaw anae vae; te Daniel te a ban hae kha chia khylan a ccung hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Siapharan a rintu bawi Ariok tuh Babilon mihaw hae kha chia khylan he a pou tuh, Daniel nynh raeringkute hawnaw bya khate siapharan inn e bawi, Ariok kha hopah zah, <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pawccemou siapharan nynh hynhcih baban arang lante kaw a tho?” cite a khia. Ariok nynh khah-e konglang kha Daniel kya ccaerarih lan a hopya. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Daniel nynh siapharan kalan cceih zah, maan asuilan leihpya khylan, siapharan nynh accyh a pya nawlan a ngiaku.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia nynh Nebukhadnezzar Maan A Leih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Te Daniel tuh a inn lang cceih zah, a ban hae, Hananiah, Mishael te Azariah kha a hopya hae, <verse number="18" style="v" />amaw Daniel te a ban hae te Babilon ram e tuhlaepaw mihaw hae tuh chia athua khyh nawlan hae, e byakhupaw konglang hynh vaawlang e Pachia kalan thawccinaw ngia khylan a hopya hae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh byakhupaw tuh khuazi vizin kyakhe Daniel kya phy athua vae, te Daniel nynh vaawlang e Pachia kha the a hoysah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniel nynh ho zah:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Hawnaw te thungnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw kya-e athua keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia min tuh she kheit koute</para>
  <para style="q2">she kheit thehoyte umsah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Aning nynh accyh te</para>
  <para style="q2">kumvaelori kha a rulae,</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sahbung hae zah a hangthung hae;</para>
  <para style="q1">mihaw hae kha hawnaw pya hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">nythyanaw a hoi hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">nynaw a pya hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Akhupaw te thuruhpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">uccaw hae kha a langsaku;</para>
  <para style="q1">mohnaw kya a umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">miakaw kha nyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">awnaw tuh amaw kya a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Pou ka minpaaw hae Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">na tungvaw lungtuabya hote,</para>
  <para style="q1">kae thehoysah,</para>
  <para style="q2">pawccecize hawnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">thungnaw kha nae pya vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">kaening nynh kae ngiapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">atu ka kya nae phypya vae,</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan nynh kaw oun pyapaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">kaening kalan nae phypya vae,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel nynh Maan A Leih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Daniel tuh Babilon mihaw hae kha chia lan siapharan nynh rya a pyapaw Ariok kalan cceih zah, “Babilon mihaw hae kha theih nan hae; kae hynh siapharan malang yn thuakhae lah, a maan kha ka leihpah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tetuh Ariok nynh Daniel kha siapharan malang khe arangte thuakhae zah: “Na maan ae leihpah kho cih paw lu kheit kha kyngpaw Judah hae laku kya ka muih vae,” a cipya. <verse number="26" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a min Belteshazzar cikuhpaw Daniel kha, “Maan ka sahpaw te ka maan asuilan kha nae leihpah kho cih tou?” a cipya. <verse number="27" style="v" />Daniel nynh siapharan kha, “Siapharan nynh na khiapaw byakhupaw hynh asuilan ae hopah khopaw ahawpaw ccungccaw, beidinhothyanaw, mitleihthyapaw, apawepaw lu kheit san um khyh, <verse number="28" style="v" />thuasalama byakhupaw asuilan ae hopah khopaw Pachia lu kheit tuh vaawlang khua kya a um, aning nynh nyathya nin kya yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha namaw Nebukhadnezzar siapharan kya ae hopya vae. Na i lya-e na maan te vizin na muih hae paw kha hynh-e hae nynh athua: <verse number="29" style="v" />Pou siapharan, na i lyakhe malang yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha maan na sah; byakhupaw ae leihpahpaw Pachia nynh malang yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha na kya ae langsahpyaku. <verse number="30" style="v" />Thuasalama ccangpaw ahysuepaw laeze hawnaw ka hoi keiccuze, e byakhupaw hynh Pachia nynh ka kya a langsahkupaw thua khyh, thuasalama siapharan nynh na maan asuilan kha na ny kho nawlan te na lung kya yn thungkuhpaw tuanaw kha na thaethya kho nawlan nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" />“Pou siapharan, ngawran na do zah, myarya lepaw zohtuh kha na muih. E zohtuh tuh myaryamaw ale, phaephae aw zah huatawpaw thua khyh; na malang khe thadyn zah a muinsan tuh ri lan a um. <verse number="32" style="v" />Tuh-e zohtuh a lu tuh sui ccipaw thua zah, a by te a kuihbaw hae tuh ngun nynh thua, a vue te a phae tuh sohin thua zah, <verse number="33" style="v" />a ccu tuh sivaw nynh thua, a ccuphe abang tuh sivaw thua zah, abang tuh anglae nynh thua. <verse number="34" style="v" />Na do lyakhe ccungccaw kuih te cyithui athua leipaw lungtungpi ccangkheit tuh amaw pou lan yn pou zah sivaw te anglae khate raekuhpaw a ccu kha deih zah zoihtatyh lan phe koi. <verse number="35" style="v" />Te sivaw, anglae, sohin, ngun te sui tuh zoihtatyh lan marya a koi hae, te hawnin ccyh lyaze huimin kya-e asipaw hawte thua hae zah, khisan nynh muih lan a um lei lan ciate ccaring a mung hae. Thuasalama zohtuh a deihpaw lungtungpi tuh myarya lepaw mua lang tang zah laephi pynpi kya phe abeih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“E hynh na maan nynh thua; atu na maan kha kae leihpah cih. <verse number="37" style="v" />Pou siapharan, nang tuh siapharan hae siapharan nynh na thua, vaawlang e Pachia nynh peenaw, huhan, thungnaw te phu-enaw kha ae pya, <verse number="38" style="v" />mih umnaw raveih um hae paw ccungccaw hae thuasah, sarangpaw hae thuasah, vaawlang e pavaw hae thuasah na kuih kya ae pya zah, minmin balyn kha a uktu lante ae rae vae, nang tuh zohtuh kya-e sui lu nynh na thua. <verse number="39" style="v" />Namaw koute nang laeze anyaa huapaw ccangpaw peenaw ccangkheit yn langkuh cih, te laephi pynpi a uk cih paw ccangthumnaw peenaw athuapaw sohin peenaw tuh yn langkuh cih. <verse number="40" style="v" />Te ccangpalinaw peenaw tuh yn um cih zah sivaw hawte a thawsae cih; sivaw nynh atyn-are balyn kha a koi a khya hawte, tuh-e peenaw nynh e hae balyn kha a koi a khya cih hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Zohtuh a ccu te a ccudung hae tuh anglae abang, sivaw abang athuapaw kha na muih thyhte, aphiakuhpaw peenaw athua cih; thuasalama sivaw te anglae apykuhpaw kha na muih thyhte, sivaw thawzung abang tuh tuh-e peenaw kya a um cih. <verse number="42" style="v" />A ccudung hae tuh sivaw abang, anglae abang athua thyhte, tuh-e peenaw tuh thungnaw a hoi zemah koi azoi cih. <verse number="43" style="v" />Sivaw te anglae apykuh hae paw kha na muih thyhte, minmin tuh lu kheit te lu kheit zuvaw lang a tang cih hae, thuasalama sivaw tuh anglae te apykuthya khyh hawte, pynkheihlan umkheihthya lan khyh hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Tuh-e siapharan hae she kyakhe papin aroh kho leipaw peenaw ccangkheit kha vaawlang e Pachia nynh a rae cih zah, tuh-e peenaw tuh mingccang hae kuih kya thua lan khyh. Kuih te cyi keiccu thua leite lungtungpi tuh mua kyate poh yn khohkuh zah, sivaw, sohin, anglae, ngun te sui hae a deihpaw kha na muih thyhte, <verse number="45" style="v" />tuh-e peenaw nynh e peenaw hae balyn hynh a roh cih hae zah a thangsah cih hae, te tuh-e peenaw tuh zungzae atyn cih. Alesaepaw Pachia nynh malang yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha siapharan namaw kya ae hopya vae. Maan na sahpaw ccaccing kha kae hopya vae, na maan asuilan kha kae leihpya vae,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel te A Ban hae Hangthungnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" />Tetuh Siapharan Nebukhadnezzar nynh a mae tebing zah Daniel kha a beik, te ccathae silawnaw te mynkhuhpaw kha Daniel kalan pya lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="47" style="v" />Siapharan nynh Daniel kha, “Thanccingte, na Pachia tuh pachia hae Pachia, siapharan hae Bawipaw, byakhupaw suilan kha a phy khopaw nynh thua, pawccecize nang nynh e byakhupaw suilan kha na phy kho vae!” a cipya. <verse number="48" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Daniel kha a rya kaesah zah aphutepaw lasung patae a pya, Babilon ram pynpi uktu lang nung zah, Babilon mihaw hae balyn kya lupi lang a nung. <verse number="49" style="v" />Daniel nynh a ngia liate siapharan nynh Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego kha Babilon ram kya ryalaw synriatu lang a nung hae. Daniel tuh siapharan inn kya a um.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sui Zohtuh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar siapharan nynh sui zohtuh ccangkheit, ahangpaw dong sung taruh, akopaw dong taruh acihpaw kha rae zah, Babilon ram Dura bialae kya a thadynsah. <verse number="2" style="v" />Te mangki hae, zipe hae, vuethoh hae, tuanaw pyatu hae, phua ccytu hae, byapiatu hae, upadi thya hae paw te ram lungkhu e bawi hae balyn kha Nebukhadnezzar nynh a thadynsahpaw zohtuh kha apnaw rae khylan sueluaku lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Tukeiccuze mangki hae, zipe hae, vuethoh hae, tuanaw pyatu hae, phua ccytu hae, byapiatu hae, upadi thya hae paw te ram lungkhu e bawi hae balyn tuh Nebukhadnezzar siapharan nynh a thadynsahpaw zohtuh kha apnaw rae khylan a sueluakuh hae. Nebukhadnezzar nynh a thadynsahpaw zohtuh malang khe he a thadyn hae tuh, <verse number="4" style="v" />bya thaesahtu nynh thawte sia zah, “Pou bya aphuinphuin a ho hae paw minphuin hae, <verse number="5" style="v" />nanning nynh mungkae, phyly, tintang, lanchi, tyng, daw te khuakupaw aphuinphuin roi kha he na thae oh te, Nebukhadnezzar nynh a thadynsahpaw sui zohtuh kha bakhungnuate na beik cih oh. <verse number="6" style="v" />Bakhungnuate a beik leipaw tuh humhung zemah arua cciamangpaw maeephupi lungkhu lang palou vua athua cih, cite kawpya na thua oh,” a ci. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ccungccaw balyn nynh mungkae, phyly, tintang, dakhin, daram te khuakupaw aphuinphuin roi kha he a thae takaw hae te, bya aphuinphuin a ho hae paw minphuin hae nynh bakhung hae zah, Nebukhadnezzar siapharan nynh a thadynsahpaw sui zohtuh kha a beik hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyatuin Khaldi hae nynh oun cceih hae zah, Judah hae kha sei a be hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Minmin nynh Nebukhadnezzar kha, “Pou siapharan, na hiinshe sae vae sah! <verse number="10" style="v" />Pou siapharan, nang nynh kaw na tho zah, mungkae, phyly, tintang, lanchi, tyng, daw te khuakupaw aphuinphuin roi a thaepaw miakaw nynh sui zohtuh kha a bakhungnua cih zah a beik cih, <verse number="11" style="v" />te bakhungnuate a beik leipaw miakaw tuh arua cciamangpaw maeephupi lungkhu lang vua athua cih, na ci. <verse number="12" style="v" />Pou siapharan, Babilon ram uknaw ryalaw kya na nung hae paw Judah hae: Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego nynh tuh nang kha pawlang ae ria khyh hae. Na pachia hae kha beik khyh hae zah, na thadynsahpaw sui zohtuh kha beik khyh hae,” cite a hopya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Nebukhadnezzar tuh myarya a thinria zah Shadrak, Meshak te Abenego kha ko lan kaw a pya hae keiccuze ko hae zah siapharan malang a thuakhae hae. <verse number="14" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh minmin kha, “Pou Shadrak, Meshak te Abenego, ka pachia hae kha na bakhungnua khyh oh zah, ka thadynsahpaw sui zohtuh kha na beik khyh oh, a ci hae paw tuh thanccingpaw athua tou? <verse number="15" style="v" />Atu nanning nynh mungkae, phyly, tintang, lanchi, tyng, daw te khuakupaw aphuinphuin roi kha he na thae oh te, ka raepaw zohtuh kha bakhungnuate beik lan na paccynku oh ze ahoy cih. Thuasalama na beik khyh oh zetuh, arua cciamangpaw maeephupi lungkhu lang palou phung na thua cih oh, ka kuih kyate ae khum kho cih oh paw pachia hummou a um?” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Shadrak, Meshak te Abenego nynh siapharan kha, “Pou Nebukhadnezzar, e konglangte na kya daangsahkunaw byaho lanpaw kae hoi khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Pou siapharan, kae beikpaw kae Pachia nynh aruapaw maeephupi kyate thuasah, na kuih kyate thuasah oun khum ze, oun khum sah. <verse number="18" style="v" />Oun khum khyh zemah, pou siapharan, na pachia hae kha kae bakhungnua lae lan khyh zah, na thadynsahpaw sui zohtuh kha kae beik lae lan khyh cipaw beih nytua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Aruapaw Maeephupi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh Nebukhadnezzar tuh Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego tungvaw a maesue phe roh lan ciate myarya a thinria zah, maeephupi kha atakaw lya laeze leit sari sosah hua oh, cite kawpya hae zah, <verse number="20" style="v" />Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego kha khii lan te arua cciamangpaw maeephupi lungkhu lang vua khylan a rhawkaw hae kyaze a thung huaccepaw abang kha kaw a pya hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lu thum hae kha mih angkile, mih langpatung, mih lukhung te ccangpaw mih boeining hae ryte khiide hae zah, arua cciamangpaw maeephupi lungkhu lang a vua hae. <verse number="22" style="v" />Siapharan kya-e kawpyanaw tuh myarya rang zah, maeephupi tuh myarya aso keiccuze Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego a hang hae paw pise hae kha maeesoi nynh phe chia hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh-e lu thum hae, Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego tuh khiidekute aruapaw maeephupi lungkhu lang a ccah hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Te Nebukhadnezzar siapharan tuh a ngaeangthua zah arangte a thokuh. Tuanaw pyatu hae kha, “Khiidete maee lungkhu lang ah phung oh paw kha lu thum thua khyh tou?” cite a khia hae. Minmin nynh siapharan kha, “Ahme, pou siapharan,” a cipya hae. <verse number="25" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Khii leipaw ccungccaw lu pali nynh maee lungkhu kya a ccia hae paw te vaemaw mue leite a um hae paw kha ka muih, lu palinaw e paw tuh pachia muinsan nynh a ke,” cite a khung hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh arua cciamangpaw maeephupi pe langkhe naekuh zah, “Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia ryalahtu hae, Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego, oun pou oh lah, hynhlang oun cciatua oh!” a cipya hae. Tukeiccuze Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego tuh maee lungkhu te oun pou hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Mangki hae, zipe hae, vuethoh hae te siapharan tuanaw pyatu hae tuh pynkheihlan sueluakuh hae zah, tuh-e lu pali hae pyn kya maee nynh thungnaw ccapyh san a hoi khyhpaw kha a muih hae; mih sangrua ccangkheit san maee nynh u khyh, mih angkile kha mah u khyh zah, maee myn sanmah myn khyh hae. <verse number="28" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar nynh, “Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego hae Pachia tuh thehoyte um sah, a vaawccungccaw hae kha sawpyate, amaw a doliakuh hae paw a ryalahtu hae kha a khum hae. Mih Pachia laelan ccangpaw pachia kha bakhungnuate beik lae tuh, mih pyn pyaku ciate siapharan kaw kha a ei hae. <verse number="29" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae nynh kaw ka tho: Pawpaw tahawpaw ccungccaw, minphuin te pawpaw tahawpaw bya a hopaw athua zemah Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego hae Pachia kha thethya a hopaw tuh a kuih a ccu khya athua cih zah, a inn kha mah aronahpaw apumkuhpaw lang a tang cih; pawccecize e hawte ccungccaw a khum khopaw ccangpaw pachia um khyh,” a ci. <verse number="30" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh Shadrak, Meshak te Abednego kha Babilon ram kya ryalaw a kaesah hae.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Vae Ningnaw Nebukhadnezzar Maan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nebukhadnezzar siapharan nynh bya aphuinphuin ho hae paw laephi pynpi e minphuin hae balyn kalan khe: Nae kya daenaw um sah! <verse number="2" style="v" />Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh rya yn lawpyapaw muihsahnaw hae te ngaeang lan umpaw balyn kha hothui ka ry.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pachia nynh a raepaw muihsahnaw hae tuh pawcih baban mou lesae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ngaeangnaw a raepaw tuh pawcih baban mou huhan a hoi!</para>
  <para style="q1">A peenaw tuh zungzae tynpaw peenaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a kya-e kawhoinaw tuh she takyh kya atyn, a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Kae, Nebukhadnezzar tuh ka inn kya ngaengan thawdangte ka um zah, ka siapharan inn kya hiinhoyte ka um. <verse number="5" style="v" />Kae yn risahpaw maan ccangkheit ka sah; ka i lyakhe ri lan umpaw vizin kha ka muih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze ka maan kha leihpya khylan Babilon ram e mihaw hae balyn kha ka malang thuakhae lan kaw ka tho. <verse number="7" style="v" />Te mitleihthya hae paw, beidinhothya hae paw, Khaldi hae te apawe hae paw tuh oun thua hae zah, ka maan kha ka hopya hae, thuasalama ka maan kha yn leihpah kho khyh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Nyathyakou khe ka pachia min liate Belteshazzar cite ko thua zah athyaapaw pachia hae muisaw te phe beihpaw Daniel tuh ka malang yn thua zah, ka maan kha ka hopya: <verse number="9" style="v" />“Mitleihthya hae paw lupi athuapaw, pou Belteshazzar, nang tuh athyaapaw pachia hae muisaw te phe na beih zah, nang na hanlan tuh myaryamaw arupaw byakhupaw um khyh cipaw ka ny. Maan ka sahpaw hynh ngaetua lah, yn leihpya tua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Ka i lya ka muihpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">vizin tuh hynhte nynh thua;</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi ngaelung khe</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya hangpaw thingku ku kheit a um.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Thingku tuh lethung zah</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya a bong,</para>
  <para style="q1">adungpaccy tuh vaawlui</para>
  <para style="q2">phe phah zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi pynpi adianaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">muih kho athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuh-e thing anaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">myarya puithya,</para>
  <para style="q1">a thae tuh myarya lung zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">ahysuepaw balyn hanlan</para>
  <para style="q1">looh lang phe azaw.</para>
  <para style="q2">Loramsaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">a mynzia kaw khe a um hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang e pavaw hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">akaran kya mih bu luakuh hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">khah-e thingku khate</para>
  <para style="q1">ahysuepaw balyn kha kua athua hae.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka ih zah vizin ka muih lyakhe ngawran he ka do tuh, vaawlang te yn rungbungpaw athyaapaw rhawviatu lu kheit a um. <verse number="14" style="v" />Aning nynh thawte sia zah a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q1">‘Thingku kha nge lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae kha loi hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">anaw kha sia lah, athae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">phiariphiarae nung hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Sarangpaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuh-e thingku kaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q1">ccue hae sah lah, pavaw hae tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">akaran hae kyate zou hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thuasalama a ccungmuing te</para>
  <para style="q2">a tharui kha sivawrui te</para>
  <para style="q1">sohinrui khate khii lah,</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi kya cciataw,</para>
  <para style="q1">nebaleihpaw lonua kya</para>
  <para style="q2">cciatawtua.</para>
  <para style="q1">Vaawlang e dangtui nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">aning kha ccawphu sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Laephi kya-e lonua hae kyakhe</para>
  <para style="q2">loramsaw hae ryte</para>
  <para style="q2">umkheih hae sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Kum sari lungkhu</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw thinlung hoi leite,</para>
  <para style="q2">sarangpaw thinlung hoi sah.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ccungccaw hae peenaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a uk cipaw te tuh-e peenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">a pya rypaw ccungccaw kha pya zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">anyaa huapaw ccungccaw hae kha mah</para>
  <para style="q2">a pya hae cipaw kha</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">a ny ccaw hae cite,</para>
  <para style="q1">thingku ngawtu hae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">tuhcite byapia hae,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e byapaenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw vaawccungccaw hae kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">kawpyanaw liate nynh thua,’ a ci.</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />E hynh kae, Nebukhadnezzar Siapharan nynh maan ka sahpaw nynh thua. Atu tuh Belteshazzar, nang nynh ka maan kha leihtua; ka peenaw lungkhu umpaw mihaw hae balyn nynh ka maan kha a leih kho khyh hae zemah, nang tuh athyaapaw pachia hae muisaw te phe na bia keiccuze maan kha na leih kho,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel nynh Vae Ningnaw Maan kha A Leih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te Belteshazzar cikuhpaw Daniel tuh sosoh lungkhu myarya a lungriathae zah a thinphang. Siapharan nynh, “Belteshazzar, ka maan te asuilan nynh na thin ae phangsah nan sah,” a cipya. Belteshazzar nynh, “Ka bawipaw, na maan hynh nang ae hua hae paw elang thua sah lah, na maan asuilan hynh na rhaw hae elang thua vae sah! <verse number="20" style="v" />Na maan kya na muihpaw thingku, myarya le zah, anaw myarya abongpaw, adungpaccy tuh vaawlui phe phahpaw, laephi pynpi adianaw kyate muih kho athuapaw, <verse number="21" style="v" />anaw tuh myarya puithya zah athae myarya alungpaw, ahysuepaw balyn hanlan looh lang phe azawpaw, aku kaw khe loramsaw hae um hae zah, vaawlang e pavaw hae nynh akaran kyakhe bu a luakunaw hae paw thingku tuh— <verse number="22" style="v" />namaw nynh na thua, pou siapharan! Nang tuh na le zah na thung. Na lesaenaw tuh houhouh le zah vaawlui phe aphah, na uknaw tuh laephi adianaw cia phe a thua. <verse number="23" style="v" />Siapharan nynh a do lyakhe, athyaapaw ngawtu lu kheit tuh vaawlang te yn rungbung zah, ‘Khah-e thingku kha nge lah rotua, thuasalama a ccungmuing te a tharui kha tuh laephi kya cciatawtua, sivawrui te sohinrui ryte khiide lah, ramkaw e lonua kya cciatawtua, kum sari lungkhu vaawlang e dangtui nynh ccawphu sah lah, loramsaw hae ryte umkheih hae sah,’ a ci— <verse number="24" style="v" />Pou siapharan, e hynh na maan asuilan thua zah, tuh-e tuh Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh ka bawipaw siapharan na tungvaw kya a thuasah lanpaw nynh thua: <verse number="25" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae laku kyate nang kha dee na thua cih zah, loramsaw hae ryte na umkheih cih oh. Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh ccungccaw hae peenaw kha uk zah, tuh-e peenaw tuh a pya rypaw kha a pya cipaw na ny mawlaezung, tangnuapaw hawte lonua kha na boukuh cih zah, kum sari lungkhu vaawlang e dangtui nynh ae ccawphu cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Thingku a ccungmuing te a tharui kha cciataw lan kawpya athua, cipaw asuilan tuh, Pachia nynh laephi pynpi a uk cipaw he na nyh te, na peenaw kha namaw hanlan bua atyn cih cinawpaw nynh thua. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou siapharan, tuanaw kae pyapaw hynh beih lawku tua: dingnaw raenaw khate na seinaw kha shawkhawkuh lah, tuaasahkunaw a teing hae paw tungvaw thawccinaw hoinaw khate na hoyleinaw kha shawkhawku tua, tuhteze nynh na hiin hoynaw ccyh asae cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukhadnezzar Maethyanaw Muenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E hae balyn nynh Nebukhadnezzar siapharan tungvaw a thuanua. <verse number="29" style="v" />Sawpaw sah haw lae ning he athang te, siapharan tuh Babilon e a siapharan inn innccuvaw khe cceih zah, <verse number="30" style="v" />“E hynh alesaepaw Babilon, siapharan umnawpaw khuapi lang cite athungpaw ka huhan te aphu-epaw ka lesaenaw hanlan ka raepaw thua khyh tou?” a ci. <verse number="31" style="v" />Tuh-e bya a ho lyakhe, vaawlang te roi roikheit yn ccae zah: “Pou Nebukhadnezzar siapharan, ka bya hynh ngaetua: Na peenaw tuh na kyate lawpya athua vae! <verse number="32" style="v" />Nang kha ccungccaw hae kyate ccaring dee na thua cih zah, loramsaw hae ryte na umkheih cih oh. Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh ccungccaw hae peenaw kha uk zah, tuh-e peenaw tuh a pya rypaw kha a pya cipaw na ny mawlaezung tangnuapaw hawte lonua kha na boukuh cih,” a cipya. <verse number="33" style="v" />Tuh-e bya tuh Nebukhadnezzar tungvaw palou accing. Aning kha ccungccaw hae kyate dee thua zah, tangnuapaw hawte lonua kha a boukuh, vaawlang e dangtui nynh a pyn kha phe a ciasah; a ming tuh mosipi ming hawte sae zah, a kuihting te a ccuting tuh pavaw ccuting hawte asae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Nebukhadnezzar nynh Pachia A Thehoysah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuh-e ccyh he athang te, kae, Nebukhadnezzar tuh vaawlang khe ka do zah, ka lungccingthui.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">the ka hoysah,</para>
  <para style="q1">zungzae hiinpaw Pachia kha</para>
  <para style="q2">sawtuate the ka hoysah.</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize a uknaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw uknaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a peenaw tuh she takyh kya atyn.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" />Laephi ccungccaw balyn tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">alakawpaw lang ria thua hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">vaawccungccaw hae te</para>
  <para style="q2">laephi ccungccaw hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">a ry hawte a cyi hae.</para>
  <para style="q2">Humhung nynh mah</para>
  <para style="q1">a kuih kha khee kho khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">“Pawmou na cyi?” cite</para>
  <para style="q1">a hopah khopaw um khyh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lyakhe, ka lungkyhthui zah, ka peenaw a phu-e nawlan ka lesaenaw te ka sung-enaw kha ka muethui. Tuanaw yn pyatu hae te ka kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh kae kha yn cciadue hae zah, ka peenaw kya uknaw kaw kha pyathui ka thua, langmawlya laeze ka huhan tuh houh alehua. <verse number="37" style="v" />Atu kae, Nebukhadnezzar nynh vaaw Siapharan kha the ka hoysah, ka hangthung zah saw ka tua;</para>
  <para style="q1">pawccecize a cyipaw balyn tuh kyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a laanpi tuh ading;</para>
  <para style="q1">a lysakuh hae paw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a nyaasah bung kho hae.</para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Belshazzar Poituanaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar siapharan nynh a kuihkaw e bawi thong kheit hanlan poitua zah, tuh-e hae malang khe misutui kha a nia.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Misutui a niatua lyakhe a kuihkaw e bawi hae, a zu hae te a lovae hae ryte misutui nia nawlan, a paaw Nebukhadnezzar nynh Jerusalem beikinn e a la lawpaw sui banang hae te ngun banang hae kha law lan kaw a pya hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Jerusalem umpaw Pachia inn kya-e a la law hae paw sui banang hae te ngun banang hae kha lah hae zah, tuh-e tuhte siapharan, a kuihkaw e bawi hae, a zu hae te a lovae hae nynh a nianaw hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Misutui kha neih hae zah sui pachia, ngun pachia, sohin pachia, sivaw pachia, thingphe pachia te lung pachia kha the a hoysah hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pang kya Zeipaw Ccaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tualeipite ccungccaw kuihdung tuh yn langkuh zah, maeekhuatung pe, siapharan inn pang vawlan khe ccaw a zei. Tuhcite a zei cciamangpaw kuih kha siapharan nynh phang a do. <verse number="6" style="v" />Te siapharan maesue tuh rulaekuh zah, myarya a thinphang. A kuih a ccu pong thyngkuh zah a ccukharu hae phaphah a buakuh hae. <verse number="7" style="v" />Siapharan nynh beidinhothya hae paw, Khaldi hae te apawe hae paw kha oun ko oh, cite thawte a sia; te siapharan nynh Babilon ram e mihaw hae kha, “E ccaw azeikuhpaw a ria khopaw te asuilan a ho khopaw tuh boeining sepaw kha lawsahku athua cih, a nging kya suisi oisah athua cih zah, ka peenaw kya bawi lu thumnaw lang a tang cih,” a ci. <verse number="8" style="v" />Siapharan kya-e mihaw hae tuh oun thua hae, thuasalama ccaw zeikuhpaw kha ria kho khyh hae zah, asuilan mah siapharan kha hopah kho khyh hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tetuh Belshazzar Siapharan tuh myarya a thinphang zah a maesue phe rulaekuh, a kuihkaw e bawi hae mah paw cyi lanpaw nyh khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siapharan te a kuihkaw e bawi hae nynh byahokuh hae paw kha siapharannung nynh he a thae tuh, poituanaw khaan lungkhu lang yn tee. Siapharannung nynh, “Pou siapharan, na hiinshe sae vae sah! Na thinphang nan sah, na maesue mah rulaekuh nan sah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Na peenaw kya athyaapaw pachia hae muisaw te phe beihpaw lu kheit a um. Aning tuh na paaw she lyaze pachia hae hawnaw te alokuhpaw hawnaw, thyanaw, nynaw a hoi cite ny athua. Na paaw, Nebukhadnezzar siapharan nynh aning kha mitleihthya hae paw, beidinhothya hae paw, Khaldi hae te apawe hae paw lupi lang a nung, <verse number="12" style="v" />pawccecize uccaw cyithyanaw, nynaw, maan leihthyanaw, lakawbya asuilan kha ccaesah thyanaw te byalungnaw hopiathyanaw kha, siapharan nynh Belteshazzar cite min a phupaw Daniel kyahin muih athua. Atu Daniel kha ko hae sah lah, aning nynh na maan kha ae leihpah cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="s1">Pang kya Zeikuhpaw Asuilan kha A Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh Daniel kha siapharan malang a thuakhae hae. Siapharan nynh Daniel kha, “Siapharan athuapaw ka paaw nynh Judah ram kyate kyng zah a cciakhaepaw Judah hae laku e Daniel tuh nang hynh tou na thua? <verse number="14" style="v" />Athyaapaw pachia hae muisaw tuh na kya um zah, thyanaw, nynaw te hawnaw na hoi cite ka thae. <verse number="15" style="v" />E azeikuhpaw hynh ria khylan te asuilan kha ka kya hopya khylan, mihaw hae te beidinhothya hae paw kha ka malang khe thuakhae thua hae salamah minmin nynh asuilan kha ho kho khyh hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh byakhupaw asuilan kha na ho kho zah, byalungnaw kha na hopia kho cite ka thae. Atu, azeikuhpaw kha na ria kho zah, tuh-e asuilan kha nae hopya kho zetuh, boeining sepaw kha lawsahku na thua cih, na nging kya suisi oisah na thua cih zah, ka peenaw kya bawi lu thumnaw lang na tang cih,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Tetuh Daniel nynh siapharan malang khe, “Na lasung tuh namaw elang tang sah, tuhkhyhze mingccang hae kha pya hae! Thuasalama tuh-e ccaw azeikuhpaw tuh siapharan nang kha kae riapah cih zah asuilan kha kae nysah cih. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pou siapharan, Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh na paaw kha siapharan lang tangnaw, lesaenaw, phu-enaw te huhan hoinaw kha a pya. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pachia nynh a pyapaw tuh-e lesaenaw liate ccungccaw hae, minphuin hae te bya aphuinphuin a ho hae paw balyn nynh amaw malang khe rih hae zah a thyngkuh hae. Ccungccaw a chia rypaw kha a chia, a hiin rypaw kha a hiin, a hangthung rypaw kha hangthung zah, a sawbung rypaw kha a sawbung. <verse number="20" style="v" />Thuasalama a thinlung yn hangsakuh zah, lungkhungte he yn lysakuh tuh, a siapharan tungkhung kyate vua thua zah, a phu-enaw kha lawpya athua. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae kyate ccaring dee thua zah, sarangpaw thinlung kha hoisah athua. Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia nynh ccungccaw hae peenaw kha uk zah, tuh-e peenaw tuh a pya rypaw kha a pya cipaw a nythya mawlaezung, ramkaw e lann hae kya umbua zah, tangnuapaw hawte lonua kha a boukuh, a pyn kha vaawlang e dangtui khate ciasah athua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Te a ccapaw athuapaw Belshazzar nang nynh tuh-e balyn tuh na ny zemah, zakawsangsakunaw thinlung na hoi khyh. <verse number="23" style="v" />Vaawlang e Bawipaw kha rawsete namaw te namaw kha na hangsahku! A beikinn kya-e banang hae kha na kalan na lawsah hae zah, nang te na kuihkaw e bawi hae, na zu hae te na lovae hae nynh misutui na nianaw oh. Ngawmuih leipaw, nawthae leipaw te paw sanmah a nyh leipaw sui pachia, ngun pachia, sohin pachia, sivaw pachia, thingphe pachia te lung pachia hae kha the na hoysah hae; thuasalama na hiinnaw te na cyisahnaw miakaw a uktupaw Pachia kha tuh saw na tua khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Tukeiccuze a umnaw kyate kuih kha sawnua zah, e ccaw hynh a zei. <verse number="25" style="v" />Te a zeipaw ccaw tuh: MENE, MENE, TEKEL, te PARSIN, a ci. <verse number="26" style="v" />Tuh-e asuilan tuh: MENE cipaw tuh, Pachia nynh na peenaw nin hae kha ria zah a thangsah vae; <verse number="27" style="v" />TEKEL cipaw tuh, zawccu vawlan khe nang kha khin na thua vae zah, na ccing leinaw kha muih athua vae; <verse number="28" style="v" />PERES cipaw tuh, na peenaw kha phia thua zah, Media hae te Persia hae kha pya athua vae hae, cinawpaw asuilan nynh thua,” a cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />Te Belshazzar nynh kawpya hae zah, Daniel kha boeining sepaw kha lawsakuh hae zah, suisi kha a nging kya a oisah hae, te aning tuh peenaw kya lu thumnaw bawi nynh thua, cite thaesahnaw kha a rae hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" />Tuh-e khuazi ccaccei khe Khaldi hae siapharan Belshazzar kha a chia hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Te sung taruh kum ning loukaw a cih vae paw Media minphuin athuapaw Darias nynh peenaw kha a law.</para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Daniel kha Pheenaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Darias nynh a peenaw a uk lanpaw mangki za kheit lu kuin kha a peenaw pynpi po lekuh lan a nung hae, <verse number="2" style="v" />tuh-e hae a uk lanpaw lupi lu thum kha nung hae zah, tuin kyaze Daniel tuh a umbua; siapharan rynaw kha accing kho nawlan, mangki hae nynh lupi hae kalan a thaesah cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Athyaapaw muisaw tuh Daniel kya a um keiccuze Daniel tuh ccangpaw lupi hae te mangki hae balyn laeze langkuh hua zah, siapharan nynh a peenaw pynpi a uktu lang nung lante a paccyn. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lupi hae te mangki hae nynh Daniel kha rawsete peenaw te asekuh lante a seinaw kha a ccungpya hae. Thuasalama Daniel tuh a lungzipaw thua zah, a tungvaw kya sawphahkunaw thuasah, seinaw thuasah ccapyh san a um khyh keiccuze a seinaw kha muih kho khyh hae. <verse number="5" style="v" />Minmin nynh, “Daniel a Pachia kawbya te asekuh lante a seinaw kha ah muihpya khyh oh zetuh, e Daniel hynh a seinaw ccapyh san ah muih vae lan khyh oh,” cite a hoku hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Tukeiccuze lupi hae te mangki hae tuh aruh lante paccynte siapharan kalan cceih hae zah, “Pou Darias siapharan, na hiinshe sae vae sah! <verse number="7" style="v" />Namaw kalan thua leite ccangpaw ccungccaw kalan thuasah, pachia kalan thuasah nin sung thum lungkhu saw a sangpaw tuh chindeih khia lungkhu lang vua athua cih, cite phungzae ccangkheit kha siapharan nynh a rae cih zah a tynsah cih, cipaw kha ram lungkhu e lupi hae balyn, zipe hae, mangki hae, tuanaw pyatu hae te uktu bawi hae nynh nawccawnaw kae hoi. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou siapharan, nang nynh kaw beih tho lah, na minthuhku tua, tuhteze nynh rulae kho leipaw Media hae te Persia hae upadi thyhte rulae kho thua lan khyh,” a cipya hae. <verse number="9" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Darias siapharan nynh minthuhkuh zah kaw a tho.</para>
  <para style="s1">Chindeih Khia kya Daniel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Siapharan nynh minthuh zah kaw a tho vae cipaw kha Daniel nynh a ny zemah, a inn langkhe leih ki zah, a inn avawlan khaan kya Jerusalem lang a hawipaw thanlan-aw kha hungte, leih a la cyimae hawte, nin kheit ze vae thum, ccukharutungte Pachia kalan sawsang zah the a hoysah. <verse number="11" style="v" />Daniel nynh a Pachia kalan sawsang zah thawccinaw a ngiakupaw kha a dokhawtu hae nynh oun thua hae zah a muihbia hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan kalan oun cceih hae zah, “Pou siapharan! Namaw kalan thua leite ccangpaw ccungccaw kalan thuasah, pachia kalan thuasah nin sung thum lungkhu saw a sangpaw tuh chindeih khia lungkhu lang vua athua cih, cite na minthuhkute kaw na tho vae khaw?” cite kaw a thopaw konglang kha a hopya hae. Siapharan nynh, “Athua, arulaekuh kho leipaw Media hae te Persia hae upadi thyhte atyn,” a ci. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh minmin nynh siapharan kha byakhungru hae zah, “Pou siapharan, Judah ram kyate kyngte cciakhae athuapaw Daniel nynh nang kha thuasah, minthuhkute kaw na thopaw kha thuasah pawlangria khyh zah, nin kheit ze vae thum saw a sang,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Siapharan nynh tuh-e bya tuh he a thae te, myarya a lungriathae. Daniel kha khum lan tuakuh zah, khuanin accaw mawlaezung Daniel kha luesah lan thawte a zuaku. <verse number="15" style="v" />Tetuh Daniel a dokhawtu hae nynh siapharan kalan cceih hae zah, “Pou siapharan, siapharan nynh a rae vae paw kawthonaw thuasah, phungzae thuasah rulae kho thua khyh, cite Media hae te Persia hae kawbya kya a um cipaw beih nytua,” a cipya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Te siapharan nynh kawpya hae thyhte, Daniel kha cciakhae hae zah chindeih khia lungkhu lang a vua hae. Siapharan nynh Daniel kha, “Lungzite rya na lawpyapaw na Pachia nynh nang kha ae luesah vae sah!” a cipya. <verse number="17" style="v" />Lungtungpi kha lah hae zah chindeih khia a khawsung kou hae te, Daniel tuh a lue kho khyh nawlan, siapharan nynh a minkhianawpaw tazeih te a kuihkaw e bawi hae tazeih kha a khia. <verse number="18" style="v" />Te siapharan tuh a inn lang cceih zah zidae looh-ae a sung; hoysahnaw mah rae khyh zah i mah ih kho khyh.</para>
  <para style="s1">Chindeih hae kyate Daniel Khumnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te, khua he yn dae te, siapharan tuh tho zah chindeih khia kalan rangsakute a cceih. <verse number="20" style="v" />Daniel a umnaw chindeih khia kalan he a naekuh te, Daniel kalan khe thinphangte sia zah, “Ahiinpaw Pachia seepaw, pou Daniel, lungzite rya na lawpyapaw na Pachia nynh nang kha chindeih hae kyate ae khum kho tou?” a cipya. <verse number="21" style="v" />Daniel nynh siapharan kha, “Pou siapharan, na hiinshe sae vae sah! <verse number="22" style="v" />Ka Pachia nynh a vaawccungccaw hae kha yn saw hae zah, chindeih hae khalang kha a hu hae keiccuze chindeih hae nynh vawsaw oun pya khyh hae, pawccecize kae tuh Pachia malang seinaw ka hoi khyh; pou siapharan, nang na malang mah hoyleinaw ka rae khyh,” a ci. <verse number="23" style="v" />Tetuh siapharan tuh myaryamaw a lungtua zah Daniel kha chindeih khia lungkhu te pousah lan kaw a pya hae. Tukeiccuze Daniel tuh chindeih khia lungkhu te a pousah hae, a Pachia kha a doliaku keiccuze vaemaw ccapyh san mue khyh. <verse number="24" style="v" />Siapharan nynh kawpya hae zah, Daniel sei a be hae paw kha kote mimaw, mih ccaaw hae te mih zu hae ryte chindeih khia lungkhu lang a vua hae. Chindeih khia lungkhu laekhu a thua maw hae khe, chindeih hae nynh zounua hae zah mih ru balyn kha zoihtatyh lan a khya hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Tetuh Darias nynh laephi pynpi phe lekuh lan ccungccaw balyn, minphuin hae te bya aphuinphuin a ho hae paw kalan ccaw a zei: Nae kya hiin hoynaw um vae sah! <verse number="26" style="v" />Ka uknaw ram pynpi kya-e ccungccaw hae nynh Daniel Pachia malang khe ri te sawtua lan kaw kae pya oh:</para>
  <para style="q1">Pawccecize aning tuh ahiinpaw Pachia,</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw Pachia nynh thua.</para>
  <para style="q1">A peenaw tuh papin roh lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a uknaw tuh thang lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh khum hae zah a luesah hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">muihsahnaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">ngaeangthua lan umpaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">vaaw te lae kya a rae;</para>
  <para style="q1">chindeih thungnaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">Daniel kha a khum vae.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Daniel tuh Darias nynh a uk lungkhu te Persia paw Sairas nynh a uk lungkhu tuh hiinhoyte a um.</para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Sarepaw Sa Pali Vizin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar nynh Babilon siapharan lang a tangnaw kum kheitnaw kum khe, Daniel tuh a i lyakhe maansah zah vizin kha a muih. Tetuh a maan kha a zei, tuh-e tuh hynhte nynh thua: <verse number="2" style="v" />Kae, Daniel nynh khuazi ka vizin kyakhe teitei lang balyn te khisan yn zaw zah rilipi kha tuileih a thosah, <verse number="3" style="v" />te myarya le hae paw sarepaw sa pali tuh rili lungkhu te oun pou hae zah, sa kheit te sa kheit lokuh khyh hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:1">Bya 13.1</ref>, <ref loc="REV 17:8">17.8</ref></char></note> <verse number="4" style="v" />Masaty e sa kheit tuh chindeih te lokuh zah, mosipi sake a hoi. Tuhcite ka do lyakhe a sake hae kha khaee athua, laekhu kyate apyn kha hangthung thua zah, ccungccaw ccu alopaw ccu ccangning khate a thadyn; te aning tuh ccungccaw thinlung kha pya athua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.4-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:2">Bya 13.2</ref></char></note> <verse number="5" style="v" />Ccangningnaw sarepaw tuh yn langkuh zah, vong te nynh aloku. Anuhlang ccu te thadyn zah, a haw te naru ccangthum kha a tei, te amaw kha, “Thokuh, saw hae kha patae ae!” cite a hopya hae. <verse number="6" style="v" />E koute, ka do lyakhe, kaesing te alokuhpaw ccangpaw sa kheit tuh yn langkuh. A ke kya pavaw sake ccangpali a hoi, alu ccangpali hoi zah uknaw kaw kha pya athua. <verse number="7" style="v" />E koute, khuazi vizin kyakhe, myaryamaw a thawsae zah ri lan umpaw ccangpalinaw sarepaw kha ka muih. A haw tuh myarya lepaw sivaw nynh thua, zoihtatyh lan a khae koute alaepaw kha a ccu te a syde. Aning maw e sarepaw hae te lokuh khyh, aki ki haw asae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:3">Bya 12.3</ref>, <ref loc="REV 13:1">13.1</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />A ki ka do cciamang lyakhe, aki hae laku kyate ccangpaw aki taraw ki kheit tuh yn langkuh; tuh-e aki taraw a um nawlan, a umty hae paw aki ki thum kha atharui ryte phoh athua hae. Tuh-e aki taraw kyakhe ccungccaw mit alopaw mit um hae zah, lysakunaw bya a hopaw mung ccangkheit a um.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 13:5-6">Bya 13.5-6</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Pachia Byapianaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka do lyakhe, bawitungkhung kha</para>
  <para style="q1">nya thua zah, avawlan khe</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae hiinpaw tuh a haung,</para>
  <para style="q1">a boeining tuh vuiraw hawte raw zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a sang tuh tuuming</para>
  <para style="q2">thyaararihpaw te nynh aloku;</para>
  <para style="q1">a bawitungkhung tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">ezazaepaw maeesoi thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a leccu hae tuh arua cciamangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">maee nynh thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Bya 20.4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:14">1.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A umnaw kyate maee tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">aluapaw vaw hawte a pou.</para>
  <para style="q1">Ccungccaw athong patae nynh</para>
  <para style="q2">ryalawpah hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a malang khe ccungccaw</para>
  <para style="q2">athong-asan a thadyn hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">Byapianaw kha tho hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">ccauh kha a kia hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 5:11">Bya 5.11</ref>, <ref loc="REV 20:12">20.12</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka do cciamang lyakhe, tuh-e ki taraw nynh a hopaw lysakunaw bya accaepaw keiccuze, tuh-e sarepaw kha theih hae zah apyn kha maee te a u hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhlaepaw sarepaw hae tuh mih uknaw kha lawpya athua hae zemah, khyapyapaw accyh kyacia mih hiinshe asae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Khuazi vizin ka muihpaw kyakhe,</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw alopaw lu kheit tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">vaawlang e maeking khate</para>
  <para style="q1">yn cciapaw kha ka muih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Te zungzae hiinpaw kalan cceih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a malang a thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:30">Mat 24.30</ref>, <ref loc="MAT 26:64">26.64</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:26">Mar 13.26</ref>, <ref loc="MRK 14:62">14.62</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:27">Luk 21.27</ref>; <ref loc="REV 1:7">Bya 1.7</ref>, <ref loc="REV 1:13">13</ref>, <ref loc="REV 14:14">14.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Bya aphuinphuin ho hae paw</para>
  <para style="q2">minphuin hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">amaw rya kha a lawpya hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">uknaw kaw, phu-enaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan lang tangnaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">amaw kha pya athua.</para>
  <para style="q1">A uknaw tuh azo cih leipaw</para>
  <para style="q2">zungzae tynpaw uknaw thua zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a siapharan thuanaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">papin roh lan khyh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:15">Bya 11.15</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="s1">Daniel A Vizin Ccaesahnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae, Daniel tuh ka lungkhu kya ka lungvawsaw zah, ka muihpaw vizin nynh ka thin yn phangsah. <verse number="16" style="v" />E hae balyn konglang ahmepaw kha khiatua khylan, ka pe um hae paw kya-e lu kheit kalan khe ka cceih. Tukeiccuze aning nynh asuilan kha kae hopah cih yn cipah zah hynhte yn hopya: <verse number="17" style="v" />E sarepaw alepaw sa pali tuh, laephi vawlan yn langkuh cih paw uknaw ccangpali nynh thua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Thuasalama Ahang Huaccepaw Pachia mithyaa hae nynh peenaw kha a mue cih hae zah, tuh-e peenaw kha zungzae te zungzae cia a ccou cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:5">Bya 22.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Te sarepaw sapalinaw konglang ahmepaw kha ny ka ry; tuh-e sarepaw tuh ccangpaw hae balyn te lokuh khyh, ri lan myarya um zah a haw tuh sivaw haw nynh thua, te sohin ccutin a hoi, zoihtatyh lan a khae koute alaepaw kha a ccu te a syde; <verse number="20" style="v" />a lu vawlan e aki ki haw konglang kha ny ka ry, te nyalangte aki ki kheit yn sae zah, he yn sae takaw te ccangpaw aki ki thum hae kha poh phoh zah, mit te lysakunaw bya a hopaw mung a hoi keiccuze ccangpaw ki hae laeze alesae huapaw tuh-e aki konglang kha mah ny ka ry. <verse number="21" style="v" />Ka do lyakhe, zungzae hiinpaw yn thua maw tuh, tuh-e ki tuh mithyaa hae te rhawdoukuh hae zah a tae hae, <verse number="22" style="v" />te Ahang Huaccepaw kya-e mithyaa hae hanlan byapianaw kha raepya thua zah, tuh-e mithyaa hae nynh peenaw kha a ccou hae ccyh tuh yn thua.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Aning nynh a hopaw tuh:</para>
  <para style="q2">“Sarepaw sapalinaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">laephi vawlan hin ccangpalinaw</para>
  <para style="q2">peenaw yn um cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e peenaw tuh ccangpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">peenaw hae te lokuh lan khyh;</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e peenaw nynh laephi pynpi kha</para>
  <para style="q2">khaleih a ae cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a syde cih zah zoihtatyh lan a koi cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Ki kihaw tuh,</para>
  <para style="q1">tuh-e peenaw kyate</para>
  <para style="q2">yn langkuh cih paw</para>
  <para style="q1">siapharan lu haw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">thua hae zah, tuh-e hae koute</para>
  <para style="q1">ccangpaw siapharan</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit yn langkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">E siapharan tuh atakaw e</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">lokuh lan khyh zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan lu thum hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a tae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aning nynh Ahang Huaccepaw</para>
  <para style="q2">Pachia kha rawse bya</para>
  <para style="q2">a honua cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">Ahang Huaccepaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q2">mithyaa hae kha</para>
  <para style="q1">vawsaw a pya cih hae,</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaapaw accyh hae te</para>
  <para style="q1">kawbya kha rulae lan a zuakuh cih;</para>
  <para style="q2">mithyaa hae kha a kuih kya</para>
  <para style="q1">ccyh kheit, ccyh ning,</para>
  <para style="q2">ccyh angankuh cia pya athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Te byapianaw a um cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">a uknaw kha lawpya athua cih zah</para>
  <para style="q2">maemihpya te khaleih ropya athua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Vaawlui zakaw umpaw</para>
  <para style="q2">siapharan thuanaw, uknaw kaw te</para>
  <para style="q1">peenaw hae kya-e lesaenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">Ahang Huaccepaw kya-e</para>
  <para style="q1">mithyaa hae kha pya athua cih hae;</para>
  <para style="q2">mih peenaw tuh zungzae tynpaw</para>
  <para style="q1">peenaw athua cih,</para>
  <para style="q2">kawhoitu hae balyn nynh</para>
  <para style="q1">rya a lawpah cih hae zah</para>
  <para style="q2">mih kaw a ngae cih hae,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 20:4">Bya 20.4</ref>, <ref loc="REV 22:5">22.5</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" />E kyahin e kong tuh athang vae. Kae, Daniel tuh myarya ka thinphang zah, ka maesue phe rulaekuh; thuasalama e uccaw hae hynh ka thinlung kya tyty ka nung.</para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Tuutepaw te Miaatepaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Belshazzar nynh siapharan lang a tangnaw kum thumnaw kum khe, masaty e vizin tuh kae, Daniel kya yn langkuh koute, ccangpaw vizin ccangkheit tuh ka kya bua yn langkuh.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Byaria 8.1 kyate phe thang cia Hebru bya nynh athua vae (2.4 kha do).</char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh-e vizin kyakhe, kae tuh Elam pee, Susa khuapi kya, Ulai vawkhu kin ka umpaw kha ka muihku. <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka do zah aki ki ning a saepaw tuutepaw sa kheit, vawkhu pe a thadynpaw kha ka muih. Tuh-e aki hae tuh parouh mawte oun toih hae, thuasalama ki kheit tuh ccangpaw ki kheit laeze asaehua, tuh-e asae huapaw tuh ccangningnaw yn toihpaw kha nynh thua. <verse number="4" style="v" />Tuh-e tuutepaw nynh niccaw lang, thahlang te alia lang a naangbia hae paw kha ka muih. Loramsaw balyn nynh tuh-e tuutepaw kha thadynnua lan ciate huhan hoi khyh hae zah, a huhan kyate a lue khopaw um khyh; a lungry hawte cyih zah a thungpaw lang a tang.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tuh-e tuh ka do lyakhe, a mit hae laku kya aki ki kheit asaepaw miaatepaw sa kheit tuh niccaw langte yn thua zah, laekhu symang leite laephi pynpi kha po a zuake. <verse number="6" style="v" />Tuh-e miaatepaw nynh vawkhu pe a thadynpaw langmaw ka muih vae paw, aki ki ning saepaw tuutepaw kha a thawzung balynte a ccuenua. <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuutepaw kalan a naenuakupaw kha ka muih, tuutepaw kha a thinrianua zah aki ki ning phe khya lan a dia. Tuutepaw tuh thadynnua ngannawpaw huhan hoi khyh, miaatepaw nynh laekhu kya phe khulia zah a syde, tuutepaw tuh miaatepaw huhan kyate a khum khopaw humhung mah um khyh. <verse number="8" style="v" />Te miaatepaw tuh myarya alesaepaw lang a tang; thuasalama a huhan a umhua lyakhe myarya lepaw a ki tuh akhya, tuh-e a ki akhyanaw kyatuin phe langkuhpaw aki ki pali yn sae zah, ccaccang langkhe a hawi hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Tuh-e aki ki pali kya-e ki kheit kyate ccangpaw ki adihpaw ki kheit yn sae zah, alia lang, nithua lang te apuithyapaw ram langkhe hawi zah myarya alethung. <verse number="10" style="v" />Tuh-e ki dihpaw tuh vaaw rhawkaw hae kyacia hang zah, vaaw rhawkaw hae abang te awsi hae abang kha laekhu lang sahbung hae zah a syde hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:4">Bya 12.4</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Vaaw rhawkaw hae bawipaw kha heize rawsete lysah nuakuh zah, tyty a raepaw maee-ute silawnaw kha ccaring a lawpya, te a beikinnthyaa kha mah a ropya. <verse number="12" style="v" />Hoyleinaw keiccuze, tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw ryte vaaw rhawkaw hae kha tuh-e ki kalan khe pya thua hae zah, beiknaw ccaccing tuh laekhu lang a vua; a cyipaw miakaw kya alaan-asui a ua. <verse number="13" style="v" />Tetuh mithyaapaw lu kheit nynh ccangpaw mithyaapaw lu kheit kha bya hopah zah, “Tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw te thuasah, ronaw a thuakhaepaw cyiseinaw te thuasah, beikinnthyaa te vaaw rhawkaw hae sydenaw te thuasah asekuhpaw e vizin hynh hohseciamou aro cih?” a ci. <verse number="14" style="v" />Te mithyaapaw nynh, “Nin thong ning za thum cia aro cih; tukoute beikinnthyaa tuh atakaw lya hawte athuathui cih,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Gabriel nynh Vizin Suilan A Ho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Kae, Daniel nynh ka muihpaw vizin kha asuilan ny lan ka zuaku. Te ccungccaw muinsan alopaw lu kheit tuh ka malang yn thadyn, <verse number="16" style="v" />te Ulai vawkhu pe khe ccungccaw roi kha ka thae zah, “Gabriel, e ccungccapaw nynh vizin asuilan kha a ny nawlan hopya tua,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1.19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:26">26</ref></char></note> <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze Gabriel tuh ka thadynnaw kalan naekute he yn cceih tuh, ka rih zah ka bakhung. Thuasalama aning nynh kae kha, “Pou ccungccapaw, na muihpaw vizin tuh accyh athangnaw kong nynh thua cipaw nytua,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tuhcite kae yn hopya lyakhe, phe ka ningkuh zah laekhu kya ka khuliakuh; te aning nynh yn kyng zah yn thadynsah koute, <verse number="19" style="v" />“Ngaetua, Pachia thinrianaw ccyh athang te yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha kae hopah cih; na muihpaw vizin tuh khyapyapaw athangnaw ccyh kha nynh a ho ry. <verse number="20" style="v" />Aki ki ning asaepaw tuutepaw na muihpaw tuh Media siapharan te Persia siapharan nynh thua hae. <verse number="21" style="v" />Miaatepaw tuh Grik siapharan thua zah, a mit ccangning laku kya asaepaw ki alepaw tuh masaty siapharan nynh thua. <verse number="22" style="v" />Aki ki kheit khya zah, tuh-e hmin kyate aki ki pali asaepaw tuh, a ram kyate peenaw ccangpali yn langkuh cih, thuasalama masaty e peenaw nynh a hoipaw huhan zeih hoi lan khyh hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Tuh-e peenaw hae</para>
  <para style="q2">athangnaw ccyh khe,</para>
  <para style="q1">mih cyiseimenaw tuh</para>
  <para style="q2">accingnaw he a thua te,</para>
  <para style="q1">arawthungpaw maesue hoi zah</para>
  <para style="q2">athyaruhpaw siapharan</para>
  <para style="q2">lu kheit yn langkuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Aning tuh huhan</para>
  <para style="q2">a hoithung cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">ri lan umpaw ronaw kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a rae cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">a cyipaw miakaw kya</para>
  <para style="q2">a laan a sui a ua cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Huhan a hoi hae paw te</para>
  <para style="q2">mithyaa hae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a roh cih hae.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Aning tuh a thyaruhnaw keiccuze</para>
  <para style="q2">hynhute a cyisahnaw liate</para>
  <para style="q1">a eenaw accing cih zah,</para>
  <para style="q2">a thinlung myarya</para>
  <para style="q1">a hangsakuh cih.</para>
  <para style="q2">Raeringnaw pyaty leite</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw patae kha</para>
  <para style="q2">a roh cih hae zah,</para>
  <para style="q1">bawi hae Bawipaw kha heize</para>
  <para style="q2">a rawse cih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Thuasalama aning kha</para>
  <para style="q2">ro athua zemah</para>
  <para style="q1">ccungccaw kuih te</para>
  <para style="q2">ro thua lan khyh.</para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Ho athua vae paw zetepakaw te awkhua takaw e vizin tuh akyhpaw nynh thua. Nang nynh vizin kha tazeih khiatua, pawccecize atu te nin patae hanlan a ho rypaw nynh thua,” a ci.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Tukeiccuze kae, Daniel tuh ka thawbang zah nin beihtaraw ka ccikhaekuh; te ka thokuh zah siapharan a rya kha law lan ka cceih. Thuasalama ka muihpaw vizin keiccuze ka ngaeangthua zah, tuh-e vizin tuh ka thaethya khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Ccungccaw hae hanlan Daniel Sawsang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ahasuerus ccapaw, a thokeinaw thyhte Media minphuinpaw Darias nynh Khaldi ram kya siapharan lang tang zah, <verse number="2" style="v" />ram a uknaw kum kheitnaw kum khe kae, Daniel nynh athyaapaw ccauh hae kha ka ria zah, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh profeh Jeremiah kya a hopaw bya thyhte, Jerusalem tuh kum sung sari lungkhu aroh cih, a cipaw kha ka ny.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 25:11">Jer 25.11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 29:10">29.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Looh-aesungte, buriboei zingkute, buhhaw phingkute Bawipaw Pachia kalan sawsangte ka ngia. <verse number="4" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> ka Pachia kalan khe seinaw phykute saw ka sang zah,</para>
  <para style="p">“Na kawbya kha zui zah nang ae sungsahpaw kyakhe zungzae tynpaw sungsahnaw te byakinnaw kha a tynsahpaw, alesaepaw te ri lan umpaw Bawipaw Pachia, <verse number="5" style="v" />kaening tuh kae sei zah kae mesei vae, na kawbya te na phungzae kyate ccanglang maekute hoyleinaw kha kae rae zah nang kha kae dou vae. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kae siapharan hae, kae bawi hae, kae minpaaw hae te ram kya-e ccungccaw balyn kalan na min te bya a ho hae paw na ryalahtu profeh hae bya kha kae ngae vae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Pou Bawipaw, nang tuh na ding; na tungvaw mih lungzi khyh keiccuze na deenaw hae ram, anaenaw te asawnaw e ram takyh kya um hae paw Judah hae, Jerusalem khuaccaaw hae te Israel hae balyn tuh atunin hynhcite maethyanaw kae mue. <verse number="8" style="v" />Pou <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char>, na tungvaw kae sei keiccuze kae siapharan hae, kae bawi hae te kae minpaaw hae te kaening tuh maethyanaw kae mue. <verse number="9" style="v" />Bawipaw kae Pachia kha kae la dou zemah, aning tuh thawccinaw te seingaethyanaw a hoi, <verse number="10" style="v" /><char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia nynh a ryalahtu profeh hae liate kaening nae nungpyapaw na kawbya hae kha kae zui khyh zah, na bya kha kae ngae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Israel hae balyn tuh na bya ngae leite, na kawbya kha eite a cceihsei vae hae. Tuhcite na tungvaw kae sei keiccuze Pachia ryalahtu Moses kawbya kya azeikuhpaw thyalawnaw kha kae tungvaw buu athua vae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Kaening te oun uktu hae kha rawsete a hopaw a bya kha tynsah zah, myarya ccihpaw shethya kha kae tungvaw a thuasah vae, Jerusalem tungvaw a thuapaw shethya tuh vaawlui zakaw kya thua boi khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Moses kawbya kya azeiku thyhte, e shethya balyn tuh kae tungvaw accah vae. Kae hoyleinaw kyate paleihkute a byaccing kha zuite, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia thawccinaw kha kae ngiakuh khyh. <verse number="14" style="v" />Tukeiccuze e shethya hynh kae tungvaw a thuasah mawlaezung <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> nynh a thinlung kya a nung. Thanccingte, <char style="nd">Bawipaw </char> kae Pachia tuh a cyipaw miakaw kya ahme; pawccecize kaening nynh a bya kha kae ngae khyh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Pou Bawipaw kae Pachia, athawsaepaw kuih te na ccungccaw hae kha Izip ram kyate na poukhae hae zah atunin cia heize na min na thaansaku, kaening tuh kae sei vae, ahme lei lante kae cyisei vae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, adingpaw na ryalawnaw thyhte, na mua thyaapaw Jerusalem tungvaw na thinrianaw te na thin-unaw tuh beih dae ccavae sah, cite kaening nynh saw kae sang; kae seinaw te kae minpaaw hae hoyleinaw keiccuze Jerusalem te na ccungccaw hae tuh kae pepan um hae paw balyn laku kya a thethahpaw lang a tang vae hae. <verse number="17" style="v" />Tukeiccuze, pou kae Pachia, na ryalahtu nynh saw ka sangpaw te kae ngiapaw hynh beih yn thaepya tua. Bawipaw, namaw hanlan, aroh vae paw na beikinnthyaa kyakhe na mitmae tuh beih awsah tua. <verse number="18" style="v" />Pou ka Pachia, na nakaring tuakute beih thaetua. Na mit beih dae lah, kae ronaw hynh thuasah, na min te ko athuapaw khuapi hynh thuasah beih dotua. Kaening nynh kae dingnaw liate thua leite, myarya lepaw na thawccinaw liate ka sawsangnaw hynh na malang kae thuakhae. <verse number="19" style="v" />Pou Bawipaw, beih thaetua, pou Bawipaw, beih yn ngaethya; pou Bawipaw, beih yn ngaepah lah, beih cyitua! Pou ka Pachia, namaw hanlan rangsaku tua, pawccecize na khuapi te na ccungccaw hae tuh na min te ko athua hae paw nynh thua,” ka ci.</para>
  <para style="s1">Lonaw Sung Sari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka Pachia kya-e mua thyaapaw ccelang Bawipaw ka Pachia malang khe ka sawsangnaw kha thuakhae te, ka seinaw te ka ccungccaw Israel hae seinaw kha phykute saw ka sang zah bya ka ho lyakhe, <verse number="21" style="v" />tuhcite sawsangte bya ka ho cciamang lyakhe, vizin kya langmaw ka muih vae paw Gabriel tuh zete silaw ccyh khe arangte ka kya yn thua.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:19">Luk 1.19</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 1:26">26</ref></char></note> <verse number="22" style="v" />Gabriel nynh kae kha, “Daniel, nang kha hawnaw te nythyanaw pya khylan atu kae thua vae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Na sawsangnaw tuh he na tho te, aning nynh ae leih zah, nang kha hopya khylan kae thua vae, pawccecize nang kha myarya ae sungsah. Tukeiccuze ka bya hynh hoyte ngae lah, vizin asuilan kha nytua:</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />“Cyiseinaw kha thangsah khylan, seinaw kha zosah khylan, hoyleinaw kha ngaethya khylan, zungzae tynpaw dingnaw kha thuakhae khylan, vizin te profeh kha tazeihkhia khylan te hmin thyaa huaccepaw kha chitui thuh khylan, na ccungccaw hae te athyaapaw na khuapi hanlan lonaw sung sari kha byapae athua. <verse number="25" style="v" />Tukeiccuze nyh lah thaethyatua: Jerusalem kha sakthuite langmaw a um thyhte umsah khylan kawpya athua nin kyate tho zah chitui thuhpaw bawi a ccyh athua mawlaezung lonaw naw sari aro cih; te lonaw sung taruh naw ning lungkhu khe Jerusalem tuh laanpi hae te tuihung hae ryte bua raethui athua cih, thuasalama tuh-e ccyh tuh vawsaw riathae ccyh athua cih. <verse number="26" style="v" />Lonaw sung taruh naw ning koute, chitui thuh athuapaw kha ahme leite a theih cih hae, nyalangte yn thua cih paw bawi a rhawkaw hae nynh khuapi te beikinnthyaa kha a roh cih hae. Tuh-e khuapi athangnaw tuh tui alepaw hawte yn thua cih zah, phe athang cia rhawtuknaw a um cih. Ronaw kong kha kawtho athua vae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Aning nynh lonaw naw kheit lungkhu ccungccaw patae ryte atynpaw byakinnaw kha a rae cih, tuh-e lonaw angankuh he thua te, silawnaw te pyanaw kha umsah vae lan khyh; anungsikuhpaw rohtupaw tuh a um cih zah, tuh-e paw tungvaw kya thangnaw kawthonaw kha a thua mawlaezung tuin kya a um cih,” yn cipya.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 11:31">Dan 11.31</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13.14</ref></char></note></para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Minphuin hae Rhawkunaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Sairas nynh Persia siapharan lang a tangnaw kum thumnaw kum khe, Belteshazzar cite minphu athuapaw Daniel kyakhe bya ccangkheit phy athua. Tuh-e bya tuh akyhpaw thua zah, myarya lepaw rhawkunaw te asekuhpaw nynh thua. Tuh-e bya kha nyhthya zah a muihpaw vizin kha mah a thaethya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Tuh ccyh lya tuh kae, Daniel tuh lonaw naw thum ngaethyate ka um vae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Aepaw thuapaw kha ka ae khyh, saw mah ka ae khyh, misutui mah ka neih khyh, chitui mah papin ka thuhkuh khyh, lonaw naw thum phe ccing lan tuhcite ka um. <verse number="4" style="v" />Masaty sawpaw, nin kuin nin pali nin, Tigris vawpi pe ka thadyn lyakhe, <verse number="5" style="v" />ngaw ka do zah laaw te kuapaw boeining kha lawkuh zah Ufaz sui taeccia cciakuhpaw ccungccapaw kha ka muih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.5-6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:13-15">Bya 1.13-15</ref>, <ref loc="REV 2:18">2.18</ref>, <ref loc="REV 19:12">19.12</ref></char></note> <verse number="6" style="v" />A pyn tuh aphutepaw lung te lokuh zah a mae tuh khozawlaekuhpaw nynh alo, a mit tuh a awpaw dahmaee te lokuh zah a kuih te a ccu tuh awrarih lan nuihpaw sohin te nynh aloku hae, bya a hopaw roi tuh ccungccaw zapi roi nynh alo. <verse number="7" style="v" />Kae, Daniel lu kheit rou nynh vizin kha ka muih; kae umkheihpaw ccungccaw hae tuh muih khyh hae; myarya thyngkute ccue hae zah a rekuh hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Tukeiccuze tuh-e myarya lepaw vizin tuh muih khylan ka makhae nynh ka umhy vae. Ka thawzung zya zah ka ngesaw tuh dawkadae lan acih, ka thaw um vae khyh. <verse number="9" style="v" />Te bya a hopaw roi kha ka thae; bya a hopaw roi kha he ka thae te, phe ka ningkuh zah laekhu kya moh ka bakhung.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Te kuih ccangkheit nynh kae kha yn kyng zah kae tuh ka kuih te ka ccukharu khate ka thokuh. <verse number="11" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Sungsah lan kou umpaw Daniel, kae hopah cih paw bya hynh hoyte ngaetua. Thadyntua, pawccecize kae hynh na kalan saw ka thua,” yn cipya. Tukeiccuze aning nynh e bya yn hopya lyakhe thyngkute ka thadyn. <verse number="12" style="v" />Aning nynh kae kha, “Daniel, rih nan, pawccecize thaethya khylan te na Pachia malang zakawsangsaku khylan na thinlung kya bya na paeku takaw nin kyamawte na bya kha thaethya thua vae zah, tuh-e na bya keiccuze kae tuh kae thua vae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama Persia ram uktu bawi nynh nin kuin lae kheit lungkhu phe yn khee. Tukeiccuze lupi lu kheit athua buapaw Mikhael tuh kae kha bawm khylan yn thua, te aning kha Persia ram uktu bawi ryte tuin kya ka cciataw hae,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.13, 21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 12:7">Bya 12.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="14" style="v" />nin athang nin kya na ccungccaw hae kya yn cyihkuh lanpaw kha nang thaethyasah khylan kae thua vae. Pawccecize e vizin tuh malang ccyh hanlan nynh thua,” yn cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Aning nynh e bya yn hopya lyakhe ka mae tuh laekhu kya ka bakhung zah bya ka ho khyh. <verse number="16" style="v" />Te ccungccaw muinsan alopaw lu kheit nynh ka mung kha yn hae zah byaho khylan ka khalang tuh ka aw, te ka malang a thadynpaw ccungccapaw kha, “Ka bawipaw, ka tungvaw teingnaw yn thuakhaepaw e vizin keiccuze ka thaw um khyh. <verse number="17" style="v" />Na ryalahtu kae nynh ka bawipaw kha pawtemou bya ka hopah kho cih? Pawccecize ka thyngkuh zah ka thawzung um vae khyh, ka hy mah um vae khyh,” ka cipya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukoute ccungccaw muinsan lopaw lu kheit nynh kae kha yn hae zah ka thaw bua yn umsah. <verse number="19" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Sungsah lan kou umpaw, rih nan, nang tuh na khyn. Na thawsae sah lah, na rawhoy sah!” yn cipya. Aning nynh he yn hopah tuh thawzung ka mue zah, “Ka bawipaw, yn hopah ccaleih, pawccecize thawzung phe nae pya vae,” ka cipya. <verse number="20" style="v" />Tetuh aning nynh, “Pawccemou na kalan kae ccia cipaw na nyh tou? Persia bawipaw kha rhawtuk khylan atu ka ki cih, te ka cceih koute Grik bawipaw tuh yn thua cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Thuasalama byaccing ccauh kya zei athuapaw kha kae hopah cih. Na bawipaw Mikhael holeite tuh ka kalan pante, e bawi hae a rawsepaw lu kheit san um khyh.</para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Media minphuinpaw Darias nynh ram a uknaw kum kheitnaw kum khe, aning kha bawm khylan te thawzung pya khylan ka thadyn.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Atu byaccing kha kae hopah cih. Persia ram kya siapharan lu thum oun langkuh cih hae. Tuh-e hae balyn laeze lu palinawpaw tuh a hoirumhua, te a hoirumnaw liate thawzung he yn hoi tuh, Grik ram kha rawse khylan ccangpaw hae balyn kha a tuhou cih hae. <verse number="3" style="v" />Te arawthungpaw siapharan lu kheit yn langkuh cih zah, myarya lepaw ram kha ukte a lungry hawte a cyih cih. <verse number="4" style="v" />Huhan a hoi cciamang lyakhe a peenaw tuh a koi cih zah vaawlui zakaw aki ki pali langkhe a phiakuh cih hae, a peenaw kha a ciihan hae nynh uk vae lan khyh hae, thuasalama aning nynh a la ukpaw peenaw zeih kha huhan hoi lan khyh; pawccecize a peenaw kha lawpya athua vae cih zah, a ciihan athua leipaw milae hae nynh a ccou vae cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />“Tetuh alia lang e siapharan tuh thawzung a hoithung cih, thuasalama a rhawbawi hae kya-e lu kheit tuh amaw laeze thawzung a hoihua cih zah, amaw laeze ram akohua a uk cih. <verse number="6" style="v" />Kum patae aro koute minmin tuh nawccawnaw a rae cih hae, alia lang e siapharan ccanung tuh thahlang e siapharanpaw kalan khe nawccawnaw tynsah khylan zu lang a cceih cih. Thuasalama tuh-e nopinung nynh huhan hoi lan khyh zah, tuh-e siapharan ciihan hae tuh tyn lan khyh hae. Tuh-e nopinung te a kya umbua hae paw, a ccaaw, amaw a bawmtupaw kha chia athua cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">“Tuh ccyh lyatuin, <verse number="7" style="v" />tuh-e nopinung a puizia hae kyate tuh-e siapharan rya a sanlae lanpaw lu kheit yn pou cih. Aning nynh rhawkaw hae kha a ccianua cih hae zah, thahlang e siapharan rhawlungrua lungkhu lang teenuate a tuk cih hae zah a tae cih hae. <verse number="8" style="v" />Mih pachia hae, mih zohtuh hae, aphutepaw sui banang te ngun banang hae kha rhawtuknaw kya-e luadepaw uccaw hae lante Izip ram lang aning nynh a cciakhae cih. Thahlang e siapharan kha rhawtuk leite kum patae a sibia cih; <verse number="9" style="v" />te thahlang e siapharan nynh alia lang e siapharan kha rhaw a tuk cih, thuasalama amaw ram lang a ki cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Thahlang e siapharan ccapaw hae nynh rhawtuk lan paccynkute, rhawkaw patae kha a pum cih hae, tui alepaw hawte malang khe a naangbia cih hae zah, a rhawlungrua kyacia bua a tuk cih hae. <verse number="11" style="v" />Alia lang e siapharan tuh a thinria cih zah, thahlang e siapharan kha ccianuate rhaw a tuk cih, thahlang e siapharan nynh rhawkaw patae kha a suelua cih hae, tuhzemah alia lang e siapharan rhawkaw hae nynh a tae cih hae. <verse number="12" style="v" />Tuhcite rhawkaw patae kha he a tae te, a thinlung tuh a hangsakuh cih, rhawkaw athong patae kha a tae hae zemah, rhaw kha po tae lan khyh. <verse number="13" style="v" />Pawccecize thahlang e siapharan nynh atakaw lya laeze alung huapaw rhawkaw patae ryte rhaw bua a tho cih, kum beihtaraw aro te, aning tuh myarya lungpaw rhawkaw hae te aenia uccaw patae ryte oun cceih cih hae.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Tuh ccyh lyakhe ccungccaw patae nynh alia lang e siapharan kha a rhaw cih hae. Na minphuin hae laku e a puatho hae paw nynh na muihpaw vizin kha ccingsah khylan rhaw a tho cih hae, thuasalama a shung cih hae. <verse number="15" style="v" />Te thahlang e siapharan tuh yn cceih cih zah laekarung thaenuakute tynkaring lan akoihkuhpaw khuapi kha a lah cih. Te alia lang e rhawkaw hae nynh thuasah, a po hae paw rhawkaw hae nynh heize thuasah thadynnua kho lan khyh hae, pawccecize douru nawlan thawzung hoi khyh hae. <verse number="16" style="v" />Tuh-e yn ccianuatupaw thahlang e siapharan nynh a rythyte a cyih cih zah, humhung nynh mah khee kho lan khyh. Ram apuithyapaw kya a um cih zah, tuin ram e atyn-are tuh a kuih kya a um cih. <verse number="17" style="v" />A peenaw balyn kya-e thawzung khate ccianua lan a tuakuh cih zah, daenaw a um nawlan a rae cih. A rhaw hae peenaw kha ro khylan nopinung kha zu lang a pya cih; thuasalama tuh-e a tuakunaw tuh thua kho lan khyh zah thane lan khyh. <verse number="18" style="v" />Tukoute rili kin e ram hae kalan a maekuh cih zah ccungccaw patae kha a kyng cih hae. Thuasalama ccangpaw rhawbawi lu kheit nynh a puathonaw kha zya a daesah cih; thanccingte, a puathonaw kha amaw toulou kalan a kisah cih. <verse number="19" style="v" />Tetuh amaw ram lungkhu e rhawlungrua kalan khe a ki cih, thuasalama thypawkute a khuliakuh cih zah a zo vae cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />“A ryalaw kha ccangpaw lu kheit nynh a sanlae cih zah, tuh-e paw nynh a peenaw tuh a phu-e ccaw cite bawi lu kheit kha a saw cih; thuasalama nin beihtaraw kya thinrianaw kya te rhawtuknaw kya thua leite a chih cih. <verse number="21" style="v" />Tuh-e paw tuh siapharan huhan pyarua leipaw ccungccaw hoyleipaw nynh a sanlae cih; aning nynh raeringnaw pyaty leite a tee cih zah, thyaruhnaw khate peenaw kha a mue cih. <verse number="22" style="v" />Amaw a doutu rhawkaw hae te Pachia Ranpibawi Lupi kha khaleih a tae cih hae zah a malang khe a theih cih hae. <verse number="23" style="v" />Te aning te ccawkunaw a rae kou hae te, amaw nynh a ling cih hae zah ccungccaw beihtaraw kyalya te a thawzung umpaw lang a tang cih. <verse number="24" style="v" />Raeringnaw pyaty leite ram lungkhu e a hoirum huapaw hmin hae kha a teenua cih hae, a minpaaw hae nynh a cyi boi lei hae paw kha a cyih cih zah, luadepaw uccaw hae kha a nee cih hae. Rhawlungrua te koihpaw khua hae kha tuk lan a paccynku zemah sosoh hanlan kyalya athua cih. <verse number="25" style="v" />Myarya lungpaw a rhawkaw hae ryte alia lang e siapharan kha rawse zah, a thungnaw te a rawthungnaw khate a lung a thosahku, alia lang e siapharan nynh alung huapaw te athung huapaw rhawkaw khate a tuk cih. Thuasalama aning nynh tae lan khyh, pawccecize a looh a ae hae paw nynh amaw kha rawsete aruh lante a paccynnua cih hae. <verse number="26" style="v" />Aning kha a phee cih hae, a rhawkaw hae tuh ro athua cih hae zah rhawkaw patae kha chia athua cih hae. <verse number="27" style="v" />Tuh-e siapharan lu ning hae tuh ahoy leipaw kha tuate ccaboi ccangkheit kyakhe hynhupaw bya kha a hokuh cih hae. Thuasalama mih tuakunaw ccing lan khyh, pawccecize khyapaw accyh zaw loh khyh. <verse number="28" style="v" />Thahlang e siapharan tuh sisua patae te a ram lang a ki cih, thuasalama a thinlung tetuh athyaapaw byakinnaw kha a rawse. A rypaw kha a cyih cih zah a ram lang a ki cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Aning tuh khyapaw accyh kyakhe alia lang e ram kha a teenua cih, thuasalama langmawlya hawte thua vae lan khyh. <verse number="30" style="v" />Pawccecize Kittim ccingbaw hae nynh a ccianua cih hae zah, aning tuh lungrote nulang a ki cih. Athyaapaw byakinnaw kha a thinria thyhte a cyih cih. A ki cih zah athyaapaw byakinnaw a vua hae paw kha pekite a oihsah cih hae. <verse number="31" style="v" />Aning nynh a saw hae paw rhawkaw hae tuh oun thua cih hae zah beikinn te koihnawpaw kha a thusah cih hae. Tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw kha a daesah cih hae zah, ro a mangpaw anungsikuhpaw kha a nung cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="32" style="v" />Byakinnaw a vua hae paw kha tuh hynpyate a soih kho cih hae; thuasalama mih Pachia tungvaw mih lungzipaw tuh tynkaring lan a thadyn cih hae zah a douru cih hae. <verse number="33" style="v" />Ccungccaw hae laku e mihaw hae nynh ccungccaw patae kha a ccangpah cih hae; thuasalama ccyh sosoh tuh thaloi te maeephupi khate chiakunaw, kyngkunaw te luadekunaw kha a teing cih hae. <verse number="34" style="v" />Tuhcite he a teing hae te, bawmnaw beihtaraw a mue cih hae, ccungccaw patae tuh ahme lei lante minmin kalan a pan cih hae. <verse number="35" style="v" />Accyh athang mawlaezung tuh, mihaw hae abang tuh syntawnaw teingte thyaasah athua nawlan hae, chia athua cih hae, pawccecize khyapaw accyh azaw mawlaezung tuhcite acyihkuh ung cih.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" />“Thahlang e siapharan nynh a lungry hawte a cyih cih. Amaw te amaw kha a hangsakuh cih zah pachia miakaw laeze alesaehua lante a tuakuh cih, pachia hae Pachia kha rawsete ri lan umpaw bya kha a ho cih. Thinrianaw ccyh tuh phe accing mawlaezung a laan a sui a ua cih, thuasalama byapaenaw thyhte cyi athua mamin cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:3-4">2Th 2.3-4</ref>; <ref loc="REV 13:5-6">Bya 13.5-6</ref></char></note> <verse number="37" style="v" />Aning nynh a minpaaw hae kya-e pachia hae kha thuasah, nopi hae nynh a sungsah hae paw pachia kha thuasah sawtua lan khyh, ccangpaw pachia miakaw kha mah sawtua lan khyh, pawccecize amaw te amaw kha humhung balyn laeze ka lehua cite a tuaku. <verse number="38" style="v" />Tuh-e hae laeze rhawlungrua pachia kha saw a tuahua cih; a minpaaw hae nynh a ny boi lei hae paw pachia kha sui, ngun, aphutepaw lung hae te amee rupaw lasung kha pyate saw a tuahua cih. <verse number="39" style="v" />Ramccang pachia kya-e bawmnaw liate atyn huaccepaw rhawlungrua hae kha a rae cih. A tungvaw nawccawnaw a hoi hae paw kha houh a hoirumsah cih hae zah, ccungccaw patae a uktu lang a nung cih hae, ram kha lasung lang a nee cih hae.</para>
  <para style="s1">Ccyh Thangnaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" />“Ccyh athangnaw kya vae tuh alia lang e siapharan nynh aning kha rhaw a tuk cih. Thuasalama thahlang e siapharan nynh marangle hae, marang rhawkaw hae te ccingbaw patae khate khiccung hawte a douru cih zah, tuh-e ram hae kha tui alepaw hawte teenuate a tuk cih hae. <verse number="41" style="v" />Aning nynh apuithyapaw ram kha a teenua cih zah ccungccaw athong patae kha a theih cih, thuasalama Edom ram, Moab ram te Ammon hae ram kyaze abyapihua hae paw tuh aning kuih kyate a lue cih hae. <verse number="42" style="v" />Aning nynh ram hae kha a tuk cih hae zah, Izip ram mah lue lan khyh. <verse number="43" style="v" />Aning tuh aphutepaw sui, ngun te Izip ram a hoirumnaw balyn kha a uktu lang a tang cih; Libia ram te Ethiopia ram nynh mah a nulang a zui cih hae. <verse number="44" style="v" />Thuasalama nithua lang te thahlang e thongpang nynh a thinphangsah cih zah, ccungccaw patae kha ro khylan te maemih khylan myarya thinriate a pou cih. <verse number="45" style="v" />Rili te apuithyapaw mua thyaapaw laku khe a siapharan bu kha a sak cih. Tuhzemah a bawmtu lu kheit san um leite aning athangnaw ccyh tuh a thua cih.</para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="s1">Michi hae Thoothuinaw</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Tuh ccyh lyatuin, na minphuin hae thungkhawtu, bawi lepaw Mikhael tuh yn langkuh cih. Minphuin hae a um takaw hae te a um boi leipaw lungriathaenaw ccyh tuh yn thua cih. Thuasalama tuh ccyh lyatuin, ccauh kya a min zei athuapaw na minphuin hae miakaw tuh luesah athua cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:21">Mat 24.21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:19">Mar 13.19</ref>; <ref loc="REV 7:14">Bya 7.14</ref>, <ref loc="REV 12:7">12.7</ref></char></note> <verse number="2" style="v" />Laenoi kya a ih hae paw patae tuh oun tho cih hae, abang tuh zungzae hiinnaw te a tho cih hae zah, abang tuh maethyanaw te zungzae theihryakunaw khate a tho cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 26:19">Isa 26.19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 25:46">Mat 25.46</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 5:29">Joh 5.29</ref></char></note> <verse number="3" style="v" />Mihaw hae tuh vaawlui a awpaw hawte a aw cih hae zah, ccungccaw patae kha dingnaw kalan a cciakhae hae paw tuh awsi hawte zungzae te zungzae cia a aw cih hae. <verse number="4" style="v" />Thuasalama Daniel, nang tuh ccyh athang mawlaezung, e bya hae hynh khawsung lah, ccauh kha tazeih khiatua. Ccungccaw patae tuh nulang malang a ccue bungthung cih hae zah hoyleinaw tuh alungthung cih,” a ci.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:10">Bya 22.10</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Tetuh kae, Daniel nynh ka do zah, ccangpaw lu ning hae tuh oun langkuh hae, lu kheit tuh vawkhu hynhlang raw thadyn zah ccangpaw lu kheit tuh khuhlang raw a thadyn. <verse number="6" style="v" />Lukheitpaw nynh laaw te kuapaw boeining kha lawkuh zah vawkhu palung lang a umpaw lukheitpaw kha, “E ngaeangnaw hae athang cia hohsemou aro ung cih?” cite a khia. <verse number="7" style="v" />Laaw te kuapaw boeining kha lawkuh zah vawkhu palung lang a umpaw lukheitpaw nynh a ranglang kuih te a voilang kuih kha vaawlang hangthung zah, “Ccyh kheit, ccyh ning, te angankuh lungkhu athua cih, athyaapaw ccungccaw hae huhan a pazaeku ccyh he yn thang te, e uccaw hae balyn hynh accing cih,” cite zungzae hiinpaw Pachia min kha phyate bya a kinkupaw kha ka thae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 10:5">Bya 10.5</ref>, <ref loc="REV 12:14">12.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka thae zemah ka thaethya khyh; tukeiccuze kae nynh, “Ka bawipaw, e uccaw hae hynh athangnaw pawtemou yn cyihkuh cih?” cite ka khia. <verse number="9" style="v" />Aning nynh, “Daniel, cciatua, pawccecize e bya hae tuh athangnaw ccyh athua mawlaezung khawsung lanpaw te tazeihkhia lanpaw nynh thua. <verse number="10" style="v" />Ccungccaw patae tuh thyaasah athua cih hae zah syntawtua athua cih hae, thuasalama ccungccaw hoylei hae paw nynh tuh thaethya lan khyh hae zah ahoy lei lante po a cyih cih hae. Thuasalama mihaw hae tuh a thaethya cih hae.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:11">Bya 22.11</ref></char></note> <verse number="11" style="v" />Tyty raepaw maee-ute silawnaw kha daesah thua zah ro a mangpaw anungsikuhpaw kha thadynsah he athua ccyh kyate nin thong kheit za ning sung takua aro cih.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 24:15">Mat 24.15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14">Mar 13.14</ref></char></note> <verse number="12" style="v" />Nin thong kheit za thum sung thum nin pangaw cia lungzite a um hae paw tuh lungtua hae paw nynh thua hae. <verse number="13" style="v" />Thuasalama nang tuh athang cia cciatua, tynkaring lan la um; ccyh athang nin kya na lasung kha ccou khylan na thoothui cih,” a ci.</para>
</usx>